<view class="page-shell home-page"><view class="home-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">星座卡牌 · DAILY</view><view class="title">给今天，一点方向</view></view><picker mode="selector" range="{{signNames}}" value="{{selectedIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSign"><view class="sign-picker"><text class="sign-glyph">{{glyph}}</text><text>{{signChosen ? selectedSign : '选择星座'}}</text><text class="chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{!signChosen}}" class="first-note">先收下一张今日灵感卡。选择星座后，这里会为你点亮专属星图。</view><view class="card-wrap {{cardAnimating ? 'card-enter' : ''}}" bindtap="openDetail" role="button" aria-label="查看今日卡片详情"><reading-card card="{{card}}" /></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary-button" style="width:100%" bindtap="openDraw"><text>抽签与自由抽卡</text><text class="button-arrow">→</text></button><button class="secondary-action" style="width:100%" bindtap="saveCard">{{isFavorite ? '已收藏 · 点击取消' : '收藏今日卡'}}</button><button class="secondary-action" style="width:100%" open-type="share">分享给朋友</button></view><view class="daily-action"><view class="section-index">01 / 今日小行动</view><view class="action-copy">{{card.tip}}</view></view><view class="ritual-entries"><button class="ritual-entry spread-entry" bindtap="openSpread"><view class="entry-kicker">01 / THE STAR ATLAS</view><view class="ritual-entry-name">三张星光 <text>↗</text></view><view class="ritual-entry-caption">心里留个问题，凭直觉选三张</view><view class="entry-fan"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view></button><button class="ritual-entry answer-entry" bindtap="openAnswer"><view class="entry-kicker">02 / A PAGE FOR YOU</view><view class="ritual-entry-name">答案之书 <text>↗</text></view><view class="ritual-entry-caption">选一个数字，收下一页温柔</view><view class="entry-book">✦</view></button></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">随心探索</view><text class="section-aside">星光牌阵 · 主题探索</text></view><view class="explore-list"><button wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="id" class="entry-row" style="width:100%" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openTheme"><view class="entry-number">{{item.mark}}</view><view class="entry-content"><view class="entry-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="entry-caption">{{item.caption}}</view></view><text class="entry-arrow">↗</text></button></view><button class="quiz-entry" style="width:100%" bindtap="openQuiz"><view class="quiz-entry-top"><text>{{quizDraft ? '继续上次测试' : '趣味自我探索'}}</text><text>{{quizDraft ? '已答 ' + quizDraft.answers.length + '/8' : '8 道题 / 约 2 分钟'}}</text></view><view class="quiz-entry-name">你更喜欢哪种充电方式？<text>→</text></view></button><view class="daily-footnote">每日内容按主题轮换 · 仅供娱乐与自我探索</view></view>
